[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 2161.03, "timestamp": "00:36:01", "text": "それ？どこですか？どこですか？テスト"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2163.79, "timestamp": "00:36:03", "text": "日付。うん。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2167.03, "timestamp": "00:36:07", "text": "だから、私にはタイミングがないんです。それは"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2172.87, "timestamp": "00:36:12", "text": "悪い。ということで、17 18 19 20 23 24 17 17。ということで、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2174.47, "timestamp": "00:36:14", "text": "うん。 3週目。うん、3週目"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2176.109, "timestamp": "00:36:16", "text": "先へ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2179.829, "timestamp": "00:36:19", "text": "うん、182の試験があるんだ。うん、君もね"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2181.75, "timestamp": "00:36:21", "text": "面白いことに、私は一度も"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2183.75, "timestamp": "00:36:23", "text": "勉強さえも。私はどんな試験なのかさえ知らない"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2188.47, "timestamp": "00:36:28", "text": "昨日、これをここに置きました。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2190.71, "timestamp": "00:36:30", "text": "それを見て、私は「うわあ、私は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2194.19, "timestamp": "00:36:34", "text": "これが俺の過去の書類だって知ってるよ、兄弟。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2197.109, "timestamp": "00:36:37", "text": "痛みは、私がそれを心配している間に"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2199.27, "timestamp": "00:36:39", "text": "日本、心配ない、集中しなければならない"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2201.99, "timestamp": "00:36:41", "text": "ここから先は一度日本語"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2205.19, "timestamp": "00:36:45", "text": "来月からは好きになる必要はない"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2207.589, "timestamp": "00:36:47", "text": "終わらせなきゃいけないのはわかってるけど、うん"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2208.43, "timestamp": "00:36:48", "text": "三番目"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2215.99, "timestamp": "00:36:55", "text": "わかった。でも、ええと、2週目と3週目"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2217.91, "timestamp": "00:36:57", "text": "週、もし開いているなら教えてください"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 2217.92, "timestamp": "00:36:57", "author": "@LordHeadAss002", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/-EWTr8l_W5L2rvpeIb